     "explanation": "The striking split — devastated object/face recognition alongside intact musical performance — shows that these functions are subserved by distinct, dissociable systems. One can be ruined while the other is spared. This is why Sacks could prescribe a life organized around music: it was the intact channel. The other answers wrongly assume functions are unified or shared a single location.",
